# 自有文档/脚本统一换行为 LF（便于跨平台 diff）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary

# 自动生成的索引在 diff 中折叠显示，减少 review 噪音
INDEX.md linguist-generated=true
